<p dir=\"auto\">A sleek and minimalist Web Proxy.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Un24M9gnpN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e92a20abbef3e68eb393bf553c37a1664df1d04056e9e144c7d5c5004b5c32c3/68747470733a2f2f696e7669646765742e737769746368626c6164652e78797a2f556e32344d39676e704e\" alt=\"Join our Discord\" data-canonical-src=\"https://invidget.switchblade.xyz/Un24M9gnpN\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\">Curly! is still in its early stages, so you might encounter a few occasional bugs. I am actively working on new features and improvements—stay tuned!</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Supported Sites</h2></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://google.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://spotify.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spotify</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Youtube</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://reddit.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reddit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://play.geforcenow.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeForce NOW</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://now.gg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Now.gg</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Features</h2></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Fast, Advanced &amp; Powerful Web Proxy</li>\n<li>Sleek &amp; Clean UI</li>\n<li>Over 600 games</li>\n<li>And a lot more features coming soon...</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Live Instance</h2></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://lilboom-l.github.io/curly/\" rel=\"nofollow\">curly</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Usage:</h2></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You <strong>cannot</strong> deploy Waves on any static hosting services.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Self-Hosting:</h2></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Login your server.</li>\n<li>Open the terminal.</li>\n<li>Run the commands bellow:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"sudo git clone https://github.com/lilboom-l/curly\n\ncd waves\n\nsh setup.sh\"><pre>sudo git clone https://github.com/lilboom-l/curly\n\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> waves\n\nsh setup.sh</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Run Waves Locally:</h2></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Go into your local machine terminal</li>\n<li>Run the commands bellow</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/lilboom-l/curly\n\nnpm i\n\nnpm start\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/lilboom-l/curly\n\nnpm i\n\nnpm start</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Once everything is set up, head over to <a href=\"http://localhost:3000\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://localhost:3000</a> to experience Waves running smoothly on your local machine!</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Run Curly on Github Codespaces:</h2></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Create a GitHub account if you don’t have one.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Log in, click the green <strong>\"Code\"</strong> button, and select <strong>\"Codespaces\"</strong> on the right.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Click the <strong>\"+\"</strong> to create a new Codespace.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After everything loads, run these commands:</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm i\n\nnpm start\"><pre>npm i\n\nnpm start</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"5\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>When done, click <strong>\"Public\"</strong> on the pop-up and access your given URL.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This project is licensed under the <a href=\"https://github.com/lilboom-l/curly/blob/bd58d232bb6f7fd4f1b6155d0fc31c044c78d3f0/LICENSE\">GPL-3.0 License</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Important</p><p dir=\"auto\">Considering giving this repository a star if you do fork and use Curly!. :)</p>\n</div>\n</article></div>"},"truncated":false,"tree":[["LICENSE",34523],["README.md",1942],["engine"],["engine/bare.mjs",16407],["engine/controller.api.j